  "reasoning": "The defendant organized a private mutual aid association and collected funds from the public without proper authorization, amounting to over 9 million RMB. This behavior constitutes illegal absorption of public deposits, which is punishable under the crime of illegal fundraising (非法吸收公众存款). No other criminal conduct such as fraud, forgery, or counterfeit money is described, so only this charge applies. According to the correction rule, the charge should be listed without the suffix “罪”.",
